\f2\insrsid3759770\charrsid9268970 ============= Bosch Sensortec COINES Software Development Kit ================
\par 
\par This package contains the Bosch Sensortec COINES (COmmunication with 
\par INertial and Environmental Sensors) Software Development Kit (SDK).
\par 
\par This SDK provides a low-level interface to Bosch Sensortec's 
\par Engineering Boards (called Application Board APP2.0 and APP3.X).
\par 
\par The user can access Bosch Sensortec's MEMS sensors through a C interface. 
\par 
\par COINES can be used along with Sensor Driver (called also SensorAPI)
\par obtained from https://github.com/BoschSensortec. 
\par 
\par Source code of some Application Board use cases are provided with the COINES SDK. 
\par The user can modify, compile and run these use cases and also some SensorAPI examples. 
\par 
